Package: plasma-nm-sstp-custom
Version: @VERSION@
Section: kde
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: plasma-nm-sstp-custom packagers <root@localhost>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: plasma-nm, libc6, libstdc++6, libkf6coreaddons6, libkf6i18n6, libkf6kiowidgets6, libkf6networkmanagerqt6, libkf6widgetsaddons6, libqt6core6 | libqt6core6t64, libqt6gui6, libqt6widgets6
Description: Custom SSTP VPN UI plugin for plasma-nm
 This package provides a standalone Plasma NetworkManager UI plugin for a
 custom SSTP VPN backend that is registered under its own service type
 (org.freedesktop.NetworkManager.sstp.custom) and its own D-Bus identifiers.
 .
 It installs only the additional plugin module
 plasmanetworkmanagement_sstp-customui.so and does not replace, remove or
 otherwise modify the stock SSTP UI shipped by plasma-nm. Both plugins can be
 installed side by side and are selected at runtime from the VPN service type
 of the connection profile.
